<title>USA: Talley, GM's Delphi complete airbag pact.</title>
<headline>Talley, GM's Delphi complete airbag pact.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, Mich. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talley Industries Inc. and General Motors Corp's Delphi Automotive Systems said Tuesday they completed a previously announced deal to form a joint venture to make advanced auto airbag inflators.</p>
<p>The Aegis venture, which was introduced in April, will produce an all pyrotechnic, non-sodium azide design driver-side inflator at a facility in Mesa, Ariz., available for 1998 and 1999 model year airbag modules.</p>
</text>
